{"id":"a25c0a66cf56c0f4","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md","title":"Elementary Embedding","display":"df-elementary-embedding — Elementary Embedding","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-elementary-embedding","aliases":["58-df-elementary-embedding"],"display":"df-elementary-embedding — Elementary Embedding","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-elementary-embedding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-elementary-embedding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-elementary-embedding — Elementary Embedding"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,M,N\\in V\">\\(j,M,N\\in V\\)</span> (a set map and two set-coded structures)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span> (structure predicate and universe operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\)</span> (typed satisfaction recursion, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}\\)</span> (assignment predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\)</span> (formula set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (set-coded elementary-embedding predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbeddingInLanguage}_S(j,M,N,L)\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbeddingInLanguage}_S(j,M,N,L)\\)</span> 是下式新增的显式语言接口；既有三元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\\)</span> 仍然存在量化语言，不改变其约定。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,M,N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists L,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(N,L,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(j,\\mathrm{Univ}(M),\\mathrm{Univ}(N))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)\\to\n\\mathrm{Assign}(N,j\\circ s)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Sat}_M(\\varphi,s)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Sat}_N(\\varphi,j\\circ s)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,M,N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists L,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(N,L,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(j,\\mathrm{Univ}(M),\\mathrm{Univ}(N))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)\\to\n\\mathrm{Assign}(N,j\\circ s)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Sat}_M(\\varphi,s)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Sat}_N(\\varphi,j\\circ s)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbeddingInLanguage}_S(j,M,N,L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(N,L,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(j,\\mathrm{Univ}(M),\\mathrm{Univ}(N))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)\\to\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle\\langle\\varphi,s\\rangle,1\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Sat}_M\n\\leftrightarrow\\langle\\langle\\varphi,j\\circ s\\rangle,1\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Sat}_N\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbeddingInLanguage}_S(j,M,N,L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&amp;\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(N,L,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(j,\\mathrm{Univ}(M),\\mathrm{Univ}(N))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)\\to\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle\\langle\\varphi,s\\rangle,1\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Sat}_M\n\\leftrightarrow\\langle\\langle\\varphi,j\\circ s\\rangle,1\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Sat}_N\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This predicate is restricted to set-coded structures and set functions. Embeddings whose domain is the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> require a separate class-level predicate.</li>\n<li>The language and both satisfaction recursions are bound inside the definition; the former formula used an unbound <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> and a satisfaction notation with no selected recursion.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}_S$, $\\mathrm{Univ}$ (structure predicate and universe operator, see [[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S$ (typed satisfaction recursion, see [[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Assign}$ (assignment predicate, see [[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)$ (formula set, see [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"j,M,N\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Univ}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assign}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbeddingInLanguage}_S(j,M,N,L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}elementary\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,M,N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists L,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(N,L,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Function}(j,\\mathrm{Univ}(M),\\mathrm{Univ}(N))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall s\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)\\to\n\\mathrm{Assign}(N,j\\circ s)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{Sat}_M(\\varphi,s)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Sat}_N(\\varphi,j\\circ s)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbeddingInLanguage}_S(j,M,N,L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N\\in V\\;\\Bigl(&\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(M,L,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\operatorname{Sat}_M)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(N,L,\\operatorname{Val}_N,\\operatorname{Sat}_N)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(j,\\mathrm{Univ}(M),\\mathrm{Univ}(N))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Assign}(M,s)\\to\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle\\langle\\varphi,s\\rangle,1\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Sat}_M\n\\leftrightarrow\\langle\\langle\\varphi,j\\circ s\\rangle,1\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Sat}_N\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false}],"bytes":3054,"backlinks":[{"id":"327fc5339902933e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,M,N)$ (elementary-embedding predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md]])"},{"id":"9ce95bfcc46dee63","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S$ (set-coded elementary-embedding predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md]])"},{"id":"c2ddd4406d7beea4","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\math